          "extracted_fact": "Join us as a delegate for our upcoming FWA International Business Conference (IBC), which will be held in Abu Dhabi and Dubai on April 19-24, 2026.",
          "excerpt": "CANCELLED: 2026 International Business Conference, Abu Dhabi and Dubai, UAE\nLOGIN\nWho We Are\nAbout the FWA\nOur History\nFWA Board\nCommittees\nCorporate Partners\nAlliances\nWhat We Do\nEvents\nAnnual Summit\nGrow, Lead, and Inspire\nNext Gen Education Programs\nInternational Business Conferences\nAnnual Awards\nGet Connected\nMembership\nCareer Center\nMember Directory\nJoin a Committee\nFWA News\nContact Us\nJoin\nDonate\nEvent Landing\nEvents\nCANCELLED: 2026 International Business Conference, Abu Dhabi and Dubai, UAE\nWhen (start/end):\nApr 19, 2026\n09:00 AM\nApr 24, 2026\n12:00 PM\nWhere:\nAbu Dhabi and Dubai\nRegister for Event\nShare this Event:\nJoin the FWA International Business Conference in the United Arab Emirates!\nThe 2026 Financial Women’s Association International Business Conference (IBC) will bring together senior professionals and emerging leaders for a week of high-level meetings, strategic insights, and cross-cultural exchange in two of the world’s most dynamic cities.\nJoin us to explore how the United Arab Emirates has emerged as one of the world’s most dynamic financial and innovation hubs, bridging capital and talent between East and West and expanding economic links with emerging markets worldwide. Anchored by Abu Dhabi’s sovereign wealth funds and Dubai’s global financial centers, the UAE combines large investment capital with a modern, English-law regulatory environment, advanced infrastructure, and a long-term national vision for sustainable growth. Its leadership in energy trans",
          "page_text": "CANCELLED: 2026 International Business Conference, Abu Dhabi and Dubai, UAE\nLOGIN\nWho We Are\nAbout the FWA\nOur History\nFWA Board\nCommittees\nCorporate Partners\nAlliances\nWhat We Do\nEvents\nAnnual Summit\nGrow, Lead, and Inspire\nNext Gen Education Programs\nInternational Business Conferences\nAnnual Awards\nGet Connected\nMembership\nCareer Center\nMember Directory\nJoin a Committee\nFWA News\nContact Us\nJoin\nDonate\nEvent Landing\nEvents\nCANCELLED: 2026 International Business Conference, Abu Dhabi and Dubai, UAE\nWhen (start/end):\nApr 19, 2026\n09:00 AM\nApr 24, 2026\n12:00 PM\nWhere:\nAbu Dhabi and Dubai\nRegister for Event\nShare this Event:\nJoin the FWA International Business Conference in the United Arab Emirates!\nThe 2026 Financial Women’s Association International Business Conference (IBC) will bring together senior professionals and emerging leaders for a week of high-level meetings, strategic insights, and cross-cultural exchange in two of the world’s most dynamic cities.\nJoin us to explore how the United Arab Emirates has emerged as one of the world’s most dynamic financial and innovation hubs, bridging capital and talent between East and West and expanding economic links with emerging markets worldwide. Anchored by Abu Dhabi’s sovereign wealth funds and Dubai’s global financial centers, the UAE combines large investment capital with a modern, English-law regulatory environment, advanced infrastructure, and a long-term national vision for sustainable growth. Its leadership in energy transition, fintech, and digital innovation, together with a commitment to collaboration and inclusive growth, make it a powerful destination for understanding how global finance and new technologies are reshaping economies worldwide.\nOrganized in partnership with leading U.S. and UAE institutions, the 2026 IBC will feature private briefings with financial and business leaders, government officials, and sovereign wealth executives; conversations with innovators driving the next wave of fintech, energy, and sustainability; and cultural programs that foster global understanding. Together, we’ll also explore how women are shaping capital, innovation, and leadership within the UAE and on the global stage.\nThe FWA delegation will include both seasoned executives and rising professionals, reflecting the FWA’s commitment to mentorship, intergenerational learning, and lifelong professional growth.\nThis trip marks the FWA’s return to the UAE following our landmark 2012 delegation. Fourteen years later, we revisit a nation that has transformed its economy and deepened its global influence, offering fresh opportunities for dialogue, connection, and collaboration.\nWhy Join the Delegation\nParticipation in the FWA International Business Conference is recognized by many employers as a premier professional development experience. Delegates return with fresh insights, expanded networks, and a deeper understanding of how global markets and leadership intersect.\nDiscover the UAE’s growing influence\nin global finance, investment, and sustainable development.\nEngage with decision-makers\nshaping capital, technology, and energy transition.\nGain firsthand perspectives\non innovation, fintech, and evolving global markets.\nExchange best practices\nin governance, inclusion, and leadership across borders.\nConnect with a powerful network\nof peers and global leaders.\nTogether, we’ll explore how women are shaping capital, innovation, and leadership on the world stage—and how the UAE is positioning itself as a bridge between regions and opportunity.\nScroll down for a preview of the program and highlights from the 2026 agenda.\nConference Registration Fees*\nEarly Bird Rates:\n$1500 Members / $2000 Non-Members (Ends December 15)\nRegular Rates:\n$2000 Members / $2500 Non-Members\n*A non-refundable fee of $500 will be retained if you cancel your registration\nIndividuals are separately responsible for personal travel and accommodations. Suggestions and recommendations will be provided to registered delegates.\nQuestions?\nReach out to\n[email protected]\nfor more information.\nProgram Preview\nHere’s a first look at some of the panels we’re planning. With more than 20 sessions and a dynamic lineup of speakers still to be announced, this is just the beginning - stay tuned for more details!\nCapital at Scale – The Power of Sovereign Wealth as Drivers of Expansion and Growth\nExplore how Abu Dhabi’s sovereign funds—ADIA, Mubadala, and ADQ—deploy capital to shape global markets, drive innovation, and redefine long-term growth.\nBeyond Banking – Wealth, Innovation, and the Next Frontier\nFrom First Abu Dhabi Bank to ADGM’s fintech hub, this session examines how financial institutions and asset managers are evolving to capture new opportunities and partnerships. Explore alignment opportunities between asset managers and UAE capital allocators.\nAbu Dhabi Securities Exchange – Building Regional and Global Capital Markets\nThe largest and fastest-growing exchange in the UAE, with market capitalization exceeding $700 billion. A regional leader in IPO activity and market innovation, with rapidly expanding listings and liquidity. A gateway for international investors to access the UAE’s dynamic capital markets.\nEnergy and Sustainability: UAE as Leader in Traditional and Transformative Energy\nEnergy is at the heart of the global economy, and discussion about it has often been a priority for FWA International Business Conferences. It will be especially important in UAE, where ADNOC is known as a major global oil and gas producer and source of innovation.\nSustainable Desalinization and Water Innovation in Arid Climates\nThe UAE depends heavily on desalination for its drinking water — about 90% of its supply. The government is investing in energy-efficient, renewable-powered desalination.\nWealth of Nations: Dubai as a Family Office & Wealth Management Hub\nHow Dubai is becoming a magnet for global family offices and private wealth, with new regulations, global banks, and generational shifts in leadership.\nAll in-person FWA event cancellations made less than 72 hours prior to the event are non-refundable\nunless otherwise noted in the event description above\n. Please review our\nEvent Disclosure\nand policies before registering for an event.\nThe FWA Annual Awards: A Tradition of Honoring Excellence\nFor decades, FWA has recognized leaders whose achievements and contributions are advancing the financial community.\nExplore the FWA Annual Awards and learn more about our past awardees.\nButton\nButton\nButton\nButton\nButton\nButton\nButton\nButton\nView more\nAbout the FWA﻿\nEvents\nMembership\nGrow, Lead, Inspire\n﻿﻿\nCorporate Partners﻿\nFWA News\nFAQs\nContact Us\n[email protected]\n212-533-2141\nFWA of New York, Inc.\n580 Fifth Avenue, Suite 820\nNew York, NY 10036-4762\n© \"Financial Women’s Association\" and the FWA logo are registered trademarks of FWA of New York, Inc.\nEvent Disclosure\nPrivacy Policy\nShare by:",
