high-performance computing customers. The IFS segment refers to full stack solutions created from the foundry industry ecosystem. The All Other segment represents results from other non-reportable segments and corporate-related charges. The company was founded by Robert Norton Noyce and Gordon Earle Moore on July 18, 1968, and is headquartered in Santa Clara, CA.\nread more\nSector\nIndustry\nEmployees\nFounded\nWebsite\nKey stock statistics\n1-day range\n52-week range\nMarket cap\nP/E ratio\nNext earnings date\nDividend yield\nEx-dividend date\nDividend pay date\nMarket cap: $504.13B\nA market capitalization above $200 billion places INTC in the\nmega-capitalization\ncategory.\nKey terms\nMarket capitalization\nSectors and industries\nNext earnings date\nAd Feedback\nSmart score\nLatest INTC news\nTipRanks\nPress releases\nToday\n11:40am ET\nNvidia Stock (NVDA) Dips Despite a New RTX Spark AI Laptop Launch\nby TipRanks\nToday\n11:40am ET\nCboe data shows mixed options sentiment in Intel with shares down 3.86%\nby TipRanks\nToday\n9:01am ET\nNotable open interest changes for October 16th\nby TipRanks\nToday\n6:54am ET\nWhy Nvidia Stock Is Rising While AMD, Broadcom, and Intel Stocks Are Falling in Premarket Today, October 16\nby TipRanks\nYesterday\n5:00pm ET\nModerately bullish activity in Intel with shares down 2.78%\nby TipRanks\nYesterday\n2:46pm ET\nAI Daily: Meta rolls out Muse Spark Open on Apple M5 Ultra Macs\nby TipRanks\nYesterday\n2:42pm ET\nIntel Stock (NASDAQ:INTC) Sinks as TSMC Fires Shot Across Intel’s Bow\nby TipRanks\nYesterday\n1:26pm ET\nMeta rolls out Muse Spark Open on Apple M5 Ultra Macs\nby TipRanks\nYesterday\n9:10am ET\nVideo: Nasdaq down as AI-linked stocks remain under pressure\nby TipRanks\nYesterday\n6:55am ET\nWhy AMD, Intel, and Nvidia Stocks Are Falling Despite TSMC’s Strong Q3 Results\nby TipRanks\nYesterday\n6:26am ET\nNew Buy Rating for Intel (INTC), the Technology Giant\nby TipRanks\nOct 14, 2026\n2:38pm ET\nIntel Stock (NASDAQ:IN